#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:272
msgid ""
"``Xc`` / ``Yc`` / ``Zc`` denote the chip's intrinsic axes (as printed in the"
" BNO055 datasheet). The \"Output\" columns are the axes the device delivers "
"via :meth:`BNO055.euler`, :meth:`BNO055.gyro`, etc. ``P0`` through ``P3`` "
"are the four 90° rotations of the chip in the component-side-up orientation;"
" ``P4`` through ``P7`` are the same four rotations after flipping the chip "
"onto its back."
msgstr ""
"``Xc`` / ``Yc`` / ``Zc`` označavaju intrinzične osi čipa (kako su otisnute u"
" BNO055 podatkovnoj tablici). Stupci \"Output\" su osi koje uređaj "
"isporučuje putem :meth:`BNO055.euler`\\ , :meth:`BNO055.gyro` itd. ``P0`` do"
" ``P3`` su četiri 90° rotacije čipa u orijentaciji s komponentnom stranom "
"prema gore; ``P4`` do ``P7`` su iste četiri rotacije nakon preokretanja čipa"
" na leđa."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:282
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 90° CCW from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = "
"-Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Čip licem prema gore, zakrenut za 90° u smjeru obrnutom od kazaljke na satu "
"od :data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . Izlazne osi: ``X = -Yc``\\ , ``Y = +Xc``\\ , ``Z = "
"+Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:288
msgid ""
"Chip face up in the BNO055 datasheet's default orientation. No remap is "
"applied: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = +Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Čip licem prema gore u zadanoj orijentaciji BNO055 podatkovne tablice. Ne "
"primjenjuje se preraspodjela: ``X = +Xc``\\ , ``Y = +Yc``\\ , ``Z = +Zc``\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:294
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 180° from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = -Xc``, "
"``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Čip licem prema gore, zakrenut za 180° od :data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . Izlazne osi: "
"``X = -Xc``\\ , ``Y = -Yc``\\ , ``Z = +Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:300
msgid ""
"Chip face up, rotated 90° CW from :data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = +Yc``,"
" ``Y = -Xc``, ``Z = +Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Čip licem prema gore, zakrenut za 90° u smjeru kazaljke na satu od "
":data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . Izlazne osi: ``X = +Yc``\\ , ``Y = -Xc``\\ , ``Z = "
"+Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:306
msgid ""
"Chip flipped onto its back (component side down) relative to "
":data:`AXIS_P1`. Output axes: ``X = +Xc``, ``Y = -Yc``, ``Z = -Zc``. This is"
" the placement used by the :class:`BNO055` constructor when no ``axis`` "
"argument is supplied."
msgstr ""
"Čip preokrenut na leđa (komponentna strana prema dolje) u odnosu na "
":data:`AXIS_P1`\\ . Izlazne osi: ``X = +Xc``\\ , ``Y = -Yc``\\ , ``Z = "
"-Zc``\\ . Ovo je položaj koji koristi konstruktor :class:`BNO055` kada nije "
"naveden argument ``axis``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:314
msgid ""
"Chip face down, rotated 90° CCW from :data:`AXIS_P4`. Output axes: ``X = "
"+Yc``, ``Y = +Xc``, ``Z = -Zc``."
msgstr ""
"Čip licem prema dolje, zakrenut za 90° u smjeru obrnutom od kazaljke na satu"
" od :data:`AXIS_P4`\\ . Izlazne osi: ``X = +Yc``\\ , ``Y = +Xc``\\ , ``Z = "
"-Zc``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.bno055.rst:320
msgid ""
